OL,3,ABank of England holds interest rates at
OL,4,A3.75%, but governor says high energy
OL,5,Acosts may lead to increase
OL,6,
OL,7,FIncreasing interest rates can slow down
OL,8,Finflation, by making borrowing
OL,9,F(including mortgages) more expensive
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, the US Federal Reserve
OL,12,Fincreased interest rates for the first
OL,13,Ftime in more than three years
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
