OL,3,AKing arrives at AI summit in Ayrshire
OL,4,Awhere he will urge tech bosses to
OL,5,Aprotect humanity
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King has arrived at Dumfries House
OL,8,Fin Ayrshire, Scotland for an AI summit
OL,9,Fwhere he's due to ask tech bosses to
OL,10,Fprotect humanity - we'll bring you
OL,11,Fimages as soon as we have them
OL,13,FHe'll be joined by AI minister Kanishka
OL,14,FNarayan and representatives of tech
OL,15,Ffirms including OpenAI, Anthropic and
OL,16,FNvidia
OL,18,FThere have been a slew of recent
OL,19,Fwarnings about the dangers AI poses for
OL,20,Fhumans - here's a recap of the debate
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
